### Read all products
GET http://localhost:3002/api/v2/products

### Create a new product
POST http://localhost:3002/api/v2/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Nintendo Switch OLED 05",
    "price": 11990,
    "category": "Console",
    "inStock": true,
    "description": "Handheld gaming console with OLED screen"
}

### Update a product
PUT http://localhost:3002/api/v2/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "MacBook Pro Max 01b",
    "price": 129000,
    "category": "Laptop",
    "inStock": false,
    "description": "Super Laptop for Ultra Good Dev"
}

### Delete a product
DELETE http://localhost:3002/api/v2/products/1